  "_comment": [
    "Round 34 (R33-20): tools pinned by hand in the workflows, which no Dependabot ecosystem reads.",
    "`reviewed` is the date the pin was last set or checked against upstream; bump it when you re-check.",
    "Every `pinned_in` text must occur verbatim in its file (CI, pinned-tools.py check-pins), so a bump",
    "in a workflow without this list fails CI. The weekly workflow pinned-tools.yml runs `report`: it",
    "fails when a newer upstream release exists or a pin is older than max_age_days.",
    "Round 38 (D2-6): `consistent` names the patterns each pin is written under and the files to search; every match must carry the one version (or `expect`), so a second, different pin of a tool fails CI. `except` allows an exact text, with its reason, and fails once it no longer occurs."
